  "description": "Jung Woo-jin, a young man who has lost his purpose in life due to harsh living conditions and a bleak routine, decides to end it all.\n\nAt that moment, a grim reaper drawn to his impending death appears and offers him a sweet yet dangerous deal:\n\n“Each time you die in a different way every week, you’ll receive 100 million won.”\n\n“But if you fail to die within a week… I’ll kill you myself.”\n\nThus begins a new life where he must die in order to survive.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/61427305), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EC%A3%BD%EC%96%B4%EC%95%BC-%EC%82%AC%EB%8A%94-%EB%82%A8%EC%9E%90/3893)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/155056)",
